  "Flip the cover and press the button. A red laser from space marks the ground in your crosshair, and eighteen seconds later a railgun hanging in the dark just past the Milky Way's rim fires down it: a beam 200 blocks in radius that kills everything inside and cuts the whole column of the world away, from the build limit to the void. Stand in the strike zone and it takes you too; in creative you are pulled clear of it first.": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。来自太空的红色激光会标记准星所指的地面。十八秒后，悬于银河系边缘外黑暗中的轨道炮将沿激光开火：半径 200 格的光束会抹除范围内的一切生命，并将整个柱状区域从建筑高度上限贯穿至虚空。身处打击范围内的你也无法幸免；创造模式下，你会在打击前被传送至安全地带。",
