  "The Shooting Star: SS-04 Seven Stars": "流星：SS-04 北斗七星",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. The Big Dipper is projected onto the land round your crosshair, seven nodes 1,440 blocks across, and its seven stars lock in the sky one after another. Out in Ursa Major they wake as the nodes of a stellar array and fire: their seven shooting stars come down one after another on their nodes, each digging a crater as wide as its star is bright and leaving a fallen star-core of glowing crystal in it. Then the lines of the figure ignite across the land node to node, cut as trenches with burning traces down their floors, and the whole constellation flares: the Big Dipper burned into the land. Everything where a star lands or a line burns dies, you too if you stand there (in creative the ground under your feet is spared).": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。北斗七星投影在准星周围的大地上，七个节点横跨 1,440 格，天空中的七颗星依次锁定。遥远的大熊座中，它们作为恒星阵列的节点苏醒并开火：七颗流星依次落向各自节点，按恒星亮度炸出大小不同的陨石坑，并在坑中留下发光晶体构成的坠星核心。随后，星座连线在地面各节点间燃起，切出底部留有灼烧星痕的沟壑，整个星座猛然绽放——北斗七星就此烙印于大地。星体落点与燃烧连线上的一切生命都会被消灭，包括站在其中的你（创造模式下会保留你脚下的地面）。",
