  "A random TV remote you found lying around. It probably does nothing... right?": "你随手捡到的一个电视遥控器。它大概什么也做不了……对吧？",
  "Press the [%s] key, and something seems to happen": "按下 [%s] 键，似乎会发生些什么",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. A red laser from space marks the ground in your crosshair, and eighteen seconds later a railgun hanging in the dark just past the Milky Way's rim fires down it: a beam 200 blocks in radius (set it from 10 to 1500 on the slider under it) that kills everything inside and cuts the whole column of the world away, from the build limit to the void. Stand in the strike zone and it takes you too; in creative you are pulled clear of it first. The damage slider under it sets each of its hits from 2 up to ∞, and at ∞ nothing it hits survives. Its speed slider plays the whole skill, film and all, from 0.3× to 3× as fast.": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。来自太空的红色激光会标记准星所指的地面。十八秒后，悬于银河系边缘外黑暗中的轨道炮将沿激光开火：光束默认半径为 200 格（可用下方滑块调整为 10～1500 格），会消灭范围内的一切生命，并将整个柱状区域从建筑高度上限贯穿至虚空。身处打击范围内的你也无法幸免；创造模式下，你会在打击前被传送至安全地带。下方的伤害滑块可将每次命中的伤害设为 2～∞；设为 ∞ 时，命中的任何生物都无法存活。速度滑块可将整个技能及其演出的播放速度调整为 0.3～3 倍。",
