  "The Shooting Star: SS-03 Gungnir": "流星：SS-03 冈格尼尔",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. Your crosshair is marked in ember, and sixteen seconds later SS-03 Gungnir — a black needle a kilometre long, loaded into an accelerator ring round Jupiter and spun up seven laps — comes down on the mark straight out of the zenith, faster than its own sound. It strikes in silence: a shock ring planes the land 400 blocks round (power 4×; from 0.1× to 20× on the slider under it) flat to the ground it struck, into a molten crater round the needle, burning its telemetry into the land, and only when the ring has passed does the boom arrive. Everything in the zone dies, you too unless you are in creative, and past it the shock still throws and hurts whatever it meets. The needle stays, standing from the bottom of the world to the build limit, its seams still burning, and its tungsten hull and conduits can be mined back with a netherite pickaxe. The damage slider under it sets each of its hits from 2 up to ∞, and at ∞ nothing it hits survives. Its speed slider plays the whole skill, film and all, from 0.3× to 3× as fast.": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。余烬会标记准星所指之处。十六秒后，SS-03 冈格尼尔——一根长达一千米的黑色长针，在木星周围的加速环中绕行七圈完成加速——将以超越自身音速的速度，从天顶直击标记。命中时寂静无声：环形冲击波将周围 400 格内的地面削平至落点高度（默认威力 4 倍，可用下方滑块调整为 0.1～20 倍），在长针周围形成熔融陨坑，并将遥测图案烙印于大地。冲击环掠过后，音爆才姗姗来迟。区域内的一切生命都会死亡，非创造模式下的你也不例外；区域外的冲击波仍会击飞并伤害沿途生物。长针将永久矗立，从世界底部贯穿至建筑高度上限，接缝仍在燃烧。它的钨制外壳和导热管道可用下界合金镐开采。下方的伤害滑块可将每次命中的伤害设为 2～∞；设为 ∞ 时，命中的任何生物都无法存活。速度滑块可将整个技能及其演出的播放速度调整为 0.3～3 倍。",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. The Big Dipper is projected onto the land round your crosshair, seven nodes 1,440 blocks across (power 4×; from 0.1× to 10× on the slider under it), and its seven stars lock in the sky one after another. Out in Ursa Major they wake as the nodes of a stellar array and fire: their seven shooting stars come down one after another on their nodes, each digging a crater as wide as its star is bright and leaving a fallen star-core of glowing crystal in it. Then the lines of the figure ignite across the land node to node, cut as trenches with burning traces down their floors, and the whole constellation flares: the Big Dipper burned into the land. Everything where a star lands or a line burns dies, you too if you stand there (in creative the ground under your feet is spared). The damage slider under it sets each of its hits from 2 up to ∞, and at ∞ nothing it hits survives. Its speed slider plays the whole skill, film and all, from 0.3× to 3× as fast.": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。北斗七星投影在准星周围的大地上，七个节点横跨 1,440 格（默认威力 4 倍，可用下方滑块调整为 0.1～10 倍），天空中的七颗星依次锁定。遥远的大熊座中，它们作为恒星阵列的节点苏醒并开火：七颗流星依次落向各自节点，按恒星亮度炸出大小不同的陨石坑，并在坑中留下发光晶体构成的坠星核心。随后，星座连线在地面各节点间燃起，切出底部留有灼烧星痕的沟壑，整个星座猛然绽放——北斗七星就此烙印于大地。星体落点与燃烧连线上的一切生命都会被消灭，包括站在其中的你（创造模式下会保留你脚下的地面）。下方的伤害滑块可将每次命中的伤害设为 2～∞；设为 ∞ 时，命中的任何生物都无法存活。速度滑块可将整个技能及其演出的播放速度调整为 0.3～3 倍。",
