  "The tesseract hums": "超立方体嗡鸣",
  "The Shooting Star: SS-05 Tesseract": "流星：SS-05 超立方体",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. A cage of light in all seven colours of the spectrum, 640 blocks across at the starting power, is painted over your crosshair and grids the land inside it into 64 cells. Out of another universe a machine of hypercubes comes through a wormhole into the sky, folds itself down through the fourth dimension and lands on the square: cracks race along the grid, the land is cut free, gravity lets go, and in four waves from the middle outward every cell is torn out a full cube deep, rock and ore and caves with it, and lurches high into the sky, turning — upright, a quarter-turn, upside down, or on its side with its strata standing up. Under it the ground drops out in tiers, deeper toward the middle, the grid burning in a rainbow on every floor. Then the cage folds into itself and a wireframe tesseract of the same rainbow light is left hanging over the middle. Everything alive in the square dies, you too. Your own cell goes up with the rest (in creative you drop into the pit).": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。由七色光谱构成的光笼会出现在准星所指之处，初始威力下横跨 640 格，将内部地面划分成 64 个网格单元。一台由超立方体组成的机械从另一宇宙穿越虫洞来到天空，经由第四维度折叠降落在方形区域上：裂缝沿网格蔓延，大地被切离，重力随之失效。以中心向外扩散的四波冲击中，每个网格单元都会连同整整一个立方体深度的岩石、矿石与洞穴一起被撕出，猛然升入高空并发生翻转——保持直立、旋转四分之一圈、上下颠倒，或横卧并让岩层竖起。下方的地面则形成越靠近中心越深的阶梯状巨坑，各层坑底都燃烧着彩虹网格。最终，光笼向内折叠，同样散发彩虹光芒的线框超立方体悬于中央。方形区域内的一切生命都会死亡，包括你。你所在的地块也会一同升空（创造模式下，你会落入坑中）。",
