  "Cleared space rings": "清空的空间回响",
  "Diving back to the Earth": "俯冲返回地球",
  "The Earth breaks apart": "地球崩裂",
  "The Earth closes up the wrong way round": "地球以错乱的朝向重新拼合",
  "A line of light opens": "光线裂隙开启",
  "Rushing through Imaginary Space": "穿越虚数空间",
  "A sea of lava": "熔岩之海",
  "The machine pulls itself back together": "机械装置重新组装",
  "The machine overcharges": "机械装置过载充能",
  "The machine drops its last blow": "机械装置降下最后一击",
  "A machine part clamps home": "机械部件卡合就位",
  "The Shooting Star: SS-06 Gravitia": "流星：SS-06 引力装置",
  "Your whole world gets sent into Imaginary Space, and it stays there for good. There is no way back.": "你的整个世界将被永久送入虚数空间，无法返回，也无法恢复原貌。",
  "Flip the cover and press the button. Far above you the whole Earth comes into view and a machine of rings closes round it piece by piece, the planet in its middle. It wakes, it fires, and all of space round the Earth is pushed away from it: the stars, the moons, the rocks, the light itself, leaving a black void ringed in white. Then the Earth breaks apart, and the pieces rush back and close up the wrong way round. A thin blue line opens across it and you fall through into Imaginary Space. This world is deleted, everything and everyone in it, and made again as an endless city of glowing blue boxes over a dark void, with a tunnel of light burning on the horizon. Nothing spawns there by itself. Nothing in it survives, whatever it is. You come back on the box top nearest where you stood, or floating there if you can fly. Everyone on the server watches it, and it can only be chosen from the menu.": "掀开翻盖，按下按钮。高空中，整颗地球映入眼帘，一台由圆环组成的机械装置逐件合拢，将地球围在中央。它启动、开火，将地球周围的一切空间向外推离：恒星、卫星、岩石，乃至光本身都被排开，只留下一圈白光包围的漆黑虚空。随后，地球崩裂，碎片疾速返回，却以错乱的朝向重新拼合。一道纤细的蓝色裂隙横贯星球，你从中坠入虚数空间。这个世界及其中的所有事物、所有玩家都将被删除，世界被重塑为黑暗虚空之上由发光蓝色方盒组成的无尽城市，地平线上燃烧着一条光之隧道。这里不会自然生成任何生物。无论是什么，原有的一切生命都无法幸存。你会在最靠近原位置的方盒顶端重现；若你能够飞行，则会悬浮在那里。服务器上的所有玩家都会观看这场演出，此技能只能从菜单中选择。",
